class.description:
Holds a list of [FoliageType]s together with, for each, the painted grass density or the placed objects. Positions are in metres relative to the terrain's origin, on the X and Z axes.
The types and their data are kept side by side and change together, which is why the type list is edited with [method add_type] and [method remove_type] rather than as an array: removing a type removes what was painted with it.
Objects can be placed from scripts, for instance to scatter props procedurally:
[codeblock]
var rng := RandomNumberGenerator.new()
for i in 200:
	var at := Vector3(rng.randf_range(-100, 100), 0.0, rng.randf_range(-100, 100))
	foliage.data.add_instance(ROCKS, at, rng.randf() * TAU, rng.randf_range(0.6, 1.4), rng.randf())
[/codeblock]
